{
	"Name": "Umbrella - Excessive NXDOMAIN Responses by Identity",
	"Description": "Detects an identity receiving more than 100 NXDOMAIN responses in a 10 minute window. High NXDOMAIN rates are characteristic of domain generation algorithm (DGA) malware searching for live command and control domains. Adjust the threshold to fit your environment.",
